<title>GERMANY: NordLB says 1996 net profit up 23.4 percent.</title>
<headline>NordLB says 1996 net profit up 23.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    185.4  up 23.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the publicly-owned German regional bank is Norddeutsche Landesbank. The bank also said its first quarter earnings before risk provisions rose 12.2 percent to 211.9 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
